  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Best Farmers Incoming Study Visit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2014, the Best Farmers competition is held annually and its 13 winners come to the Netherlands. In the Netherlands they will go on company visits to exchange knowledge and will implement the lessons learned back home. Making &#x2018;Farming as a Business&#x2019; popular again, especially amongst youth, is the overarching goal of the Best Farmers competition. This visit contributes to food security, climate resilience and sustained economic development, whilst also improving the bilateral relation between the Netherlands and Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
